        "text_pzFReX": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Slabaugh Farms is a multi-generational family farm with a rich legacy dating back to 1931, when John Slabaugh first purchased land in Clinton Township—land that has remained in the Slabaugh family ever since.</p><p>Now operated by <strong>Mark Slabaugh and his family</strong>, the farm has grown to specialize in <strong>corn, soybeans, and hay</strong> while maintaining a strong focus on <strong>beef cattle production</strong>. Their <strong>purebred Angus herd</strong> produces high-quality <strong>breeding stock and freezer beef</strong>, providing customers with premium farm-to-table meat.</p><p>Our cattle graze on <strong>nutrient-rich pastures</strong>, free from added hormones and antibiotics, ensuring <strong>healthy, natural beef with exceptional taste and tenderness</strong>. From juicy steaks to hearty roasts, every cut reflects our dedication to <strong>raising cattle the right way.</strong></p><p><strong>From our farm to your table—quality you can trust, raised with care.</strong></p>",
            "width": "fit-content",
            "max_width": "none",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "custom",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "1.25rem",
